        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(scripts): bound check-workflows subprocesses",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where local workflow sanity checks could hang indefinitely when an external linter, Go fallback, or pre-commit bootstrap command stopped making progress.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n`scripts/check-workflows.mjs` now applies a bounded timeout to each subprocess it launches, escalates non-cooperative children after a short grace period, and reports which command timed out. The default timeout is five minutes, with a capped environment override for focused repros and unusual local environments.\n\n## User Impact\n\nDevelopers and CI jobs get a clear failure instead of a stuck workflow sanity check when a dependency command hangs.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs test/scripts/check-workflows.test.ts`\n- Real entrypoint proof with an `actionlint` fixture that ignores `SIGTERM`:\n\n```text\n$ PATH=\"$fixture/bin\" OPENCLAW_CHECK_WORKFLOWS_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_MS=500 node scripts/check-workflows.mjs\nentrypoint: node scripts/check-workflows.mjs\nfixture: actionlint --version succeeds; actionlint workflow scan ignores SIGTERM\nstatus: 1\nstderr: [check-workflows] timed out after 500ms: actionlint .github/workflows/android-release.yml ... .github/workflows/workflow-sanity.yml\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>proof-check-workflows-timeout.sh</summary>\n\n```sh\n#!/bin/sh\nset -eu\n\nnode_bin=\"$(command -v node)\"\nproof_dir=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\nmkdir -p \"$proof_dir/bin\"\n\ncat > \"$proof_dir/bin/actionlint\" <<SH\n#!$node_bin\nif (process.argv[2] === \"--version\") process.exit(0);\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => {});\nsetInterval(() => {}, 10_000);\nSH\nchmod +x \"$proof_dir/bin/actionlint\"\n\nset +e\nPATH=\"$proof_dir/bin\" OPENCLAW_CHECK_WORKFLOWS_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_MS=500 \"$node_bin\" scripts/check-workflows.mjs >\"$proof_dir/stdout.txt\" 2>\"$proof_dir/stderr.txt\"\nexit_code=$?\nset -e\n\nprintf 'entrypoint: node scripts/check-workflows.mjs\\n'\nprintf 'fixture: actionlint --version succeeds; actionlint workflow scan ignores SIGTERM\\n'\nprintf 'status: %s\\n' \"$exit_code\"\nprintf 'stderr: %s\\n' \"$(tr '\\n' ' ' < \"$proof_dir/stderr.txt\" | sed 's/  */ /g')\"\n```\n\n</details>\n\nAI-assisted: built with Codex\n",
